{"sourceUrl":"https://zf.nenu.edu.cn/info/1063/9458.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:04.892786+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://zf.nenu.edu.cn/info/1063/9458.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p><p><span><span>根据《东北师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生招生录取工作办法》要求，结合</span></span><span>本单位</span><span>学科专业实际情况，现将</span><span>本单位</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>年综合考核实施细则公布如下：</span></p><p><span>一</span><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>推免拟招生层次、专业、人数、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（一）拟招生层次、专业、人数、</span></strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>层次</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业（方向）名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>拟</span></strong><strong><span>招生</span></strong><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学习方式</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>030100</span></p><p><span>法学</span></p><p><br/></p></td><td><p><span>01法学理论</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>02宪法学与行政法学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>03刑法学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>04民商法学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>030200</span></p><p><span>政治学</span></p><p><br/></p></td><td><p><span>01政治学理论</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>02中外政治制度</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>03国际政治</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>04国际关系</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>06廉洁治理</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>030505</span></p><p><span>思想政治教育</span></p></td><td><p><span>00不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>035101</span></p><p><span>法律（非法学）</span></p></td><td><p><span>00不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>14</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>035102</span></p><p><span>法律（法学）</span></p></td><td><p><span>00不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>25</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>040102</span></p><p><span>课程与教学论</span></p></td><td><p><span>00不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>045102</span></p><p><span>学科教学（思政）</span></p></td><td><p><span>00不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>120400</span></p><p><span>公共管理学</span></p></td><td><p><span>01行政管理</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>（二）考生申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法，品德良好。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊或违反学术道德、专业伦理的不当行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span><span>具有教育部批准推免资格的高校的优秀应届本科生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span><span>获得本科所在高校推荐免试资格</span><span>[</span><span>以推荐高校在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“教育部推免服务系统”）中公示、备案的名单为准</span><span>]</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.</span><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的分析问题、解决问题的能力和较强的创新意识。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免</span></span><span>招生</span><span>实际专业</span><span>、申请条件</span><span><span>以《东北师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生专业目录》《东北师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>直博生招生专业目录》（预计今年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span>下旬</span><span>发布，请关注东北师范大学研究生院网站）为准。拟</span><span>招生</span><span>人数</span><span>目前</span><span>仅供参考，录取时将根据生源状况和学校学科发展需要</span><span>对招生计划</span><span>进行适当调整。</span></p><p><span>二</span><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>报名</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>拟申请</span></span><span>本单位</span><span><span>2027</span><span>年推免</span></span><span>研究生</span><span>的应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校）</span><span><span>须于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>:00</span></span><span>至</span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>08</span><span><span>:00</span></span><span><span>登录</span><span>“东北师范大学研究生招生服务系统”（网址：</span><span>https://yz.nenu.edu.cn/ybm</span><span>，以下简称“学校系统”）完成报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>考生报名前应当认真了解并仔细核对本人是否符合</span></span><span>本单位</span><span>报考条件。因不符合报考条件及相关政策要求，后续产生的不能考核或录取等相关后果，由考生本人承担。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span><span>考生须提前准备并在报名时将以下材料电子版上传至</span></span><span>学校</span><span>系统对应项中：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）近期</span><span>1</span><span>寸、免冠、彩色、竖版、证件照。（必传，上传至“证件照”项）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）有效居民身份证。（必传，上传至“身份证”项）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）本科课程成绩单扫描件。（必传，上传至“成绩单”项）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）外语水平证明材料扫描件。（如有，上传至“外语水平等级考试佐证材料”项）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）高水平专业竞赛获奖证书及佐证材料。（如有，上传至“高水平专业竞赛获奖情况佐证材料”项）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）中国高等教育学生信息网（学信网）下载的《教育部学籍在线验证报告》。（必传）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>7</span><span>）《东北师范大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生诚信考试承诺书》。（必传）</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>）其他获奖证书和已取得的科研成果（含专利、公开发表的学术性论文、出版物或其他原创性工作成果等）的清单和证明材料。（如有）</span></p><p><span><span>上述（</span><span>6</span><span>）（</span><span>7</span><span>）（</span><span>8</span><span>）材料合并为一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件上传至“佐证材料”。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>综合考核</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>材料审核</span></strong></p><p><span>报名</span><span><span>截止后，</span></span><span>本单位</span><span><span>将</span></span><span>组织专家组对推免生提交材料进行审核，择优遴选确定后续考核名单，</span><span><span>预计于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>17:00</span><span>前在本单位网站公布，并通过电话方式通知入围考生。</span></span></p><p><span>考生应按要求的时间、地点及方式参加后续考核，未按时参加者视为放弃考核。</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）考核形式、环节</span></strong></p><p><span>本单位综合考核后续环节采取</span><span>现场</span><span>形式，包括面试、思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></p><p><strong><span>（三）考核流程、日程</span></strong></p><p><span>学院</span><span>预计</span><span><span>于</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span>9月</span><span>1</span><span>9</span><span>日进行复试</span><span>（以实际通知为准），详细日程安排另行在政法学院网站公布。</span></p><p><span>考核</span><span>现场，考生须携带本人有效居民身份证。</span><span>本单位</span><span>将对考生进行身份核验。</span></p><p><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>成绩计算办法</span></strong></p><p><span>综合考核</span><span><span>成绩满分为</span><span>100分，60分（含）以上为合格。</span></span></p><p><span>思想政治素质和品德考核不作量化计入总成绩，但考核结果不合格者不予录取。</span></p><p><span>学院</span><span>将推免生综合考核成绩由高到低排序、结合分专业或分类型招生计划、择优确定拟录取名单。</span></p><p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、其他</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>教育部推免服务系统开通后（具体开通时间以教育部推免服务系统规定时间为准），获得推免资格的申请者登录教育部推免服务系统填报专业志愿，及时查看复试通知和待录取通知，并完成接受复试确认和接受待录取环节。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>已在学校系统中报名的申请者仍须在教育部推免服务系统中报名。未经过教育部推免服务系统接收的推免生一律无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>未在学校系统中报名的申请者如有意愿报考我校，可在教育部推免服务系统中报名。报考院部将结合实际，确定是否再次组织综合考核。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span><span>、咨询申诉渠道</span></span></strong></p><p><span>本单位</span><span><span>联系咨询方式：</span>0431-</span><span>84536373</span></p><p><span>本单位</span><span><span>监督举报方式：</span>0431-</span><span>8453</span><span>6166</span><span><span>，电子邮箱：</span></span><span>wangn334@nenu.edu.cn</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>                                                           <span>政法学院</span></span></p><p><span>                                                           <span>2026年9月11日</span></span>    <br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"743f17275bbc5015a97d03966f1c7b8607a656530a188df8eeb213c56c94acb4","textLength":2115,"sourceSha256":"ec05c7fa833d73253124eba255d21f334a00ff44b93339af6a290d01a176b7cb","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6a656898acf336769896","title":"2026年东北师范大学政法学院2027年推免招生录取综合考核实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:04.892786+00:00"}
